{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The heat-shrink kits fit a concrete follow-up to my wire connectors: insulating finished connections. I would choose the adhesive-lined kit this time because it also seals them.",
    "The epoxy fits my interest in practical repair supplies and offers a way to make rigid repairs where my duct tape or vinyl cement may not suit the material."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The battery lugs and threaded valve require specific cable sizes or fittings. My connector and hose-clamp purchases do not establish that I need those particular parts.",
    "Grinding discs, cutting wheels, a feeler gauge, a thermometer, and lubricant each need a particular job to justify buying them. I have no current use for them just because I have bought other repair supplies."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Buying fastening and repair supplies seems to have been taken as interest in a broad range of workshop tools and consumables.",
    "My wire connectors and hose clamps seem to have been treated as reasons to suggest other electrical and plumbing parts without enough attention to their exact fit or purpose."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "A useful next choice should complete something I can do with supplies I already have, as heat shrink does for my crimp connections.",
    "I buy selectively when there is a clear use. Even two relevant heat-shrink kits would not both be purchases now, and specialized parts need a stronger reason than a loose connection to an earlier purchase."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my interest in practical repairs but stretched it too far into specialized tools and parts without a clear current use."
}"}
